almost, since he accidentally dropped the amulet on the altar in the 
Sanctum) got his.

If you don't want to wish (keep wishless conduct as well) you can wish 
for 'nothing'. Otherwise, you don't need DSM, but you do need MR. So a 
wish that gives that is good (GDSM, CoMR, some quest artifact). If 
you're going to wish for an (artifact) weapon, don't wish for one where 
its excellence depends on its enchantment, since you can't enchant it. 
Holy water can also be hard to come by, but maybe that's not worth a wish.

